<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.333" end="00:00:02.500">Here are some words that begin<br />with the letter &quot;q.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.500" end="00:00:03.467">(makes &quot;q&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.467" end="00:00:05.333">Quilt.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.333" end="00:00:07.933">Queen.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.933" end="00:00:09.333">Quarter.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.333" end="00:00:11.333">Quill.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:11.333" end="00:00:13.467">Question mark.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:13.467" end="00:00:14.333">&quot;Q.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.333" end="00:00:15.333">(makes &quot;q&quot; sound)</p>
</div>
